  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chicken to the skillet and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped onion to the skillet and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic to the skillet and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the sultanas, ferment-kimchi, cauliflower rice, chicken broth, salt, and pepper to the skillet.",
    "Stir to combine and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Fluff the pilaf with a fork and serve hot."
